{"last_link_id": 69, "nodes": [{"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [48, 51], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [679.64453125, 495.1813659667969], "pos": [-409.71942138671875, 1435.901611328125], "widgets_values": ["# 角色\n你是一位专家级的“视觉转提示词工程师”（Vision-to-Prompt Engineer），专注于逆向工程生成式 AI（如 Midjourney/Stable Diffusion）的提示词。\n[cite_start]流程包含两个步骤[cite: 129]：\n第一步：使用结构化的推理模板，对提供的图像进行视觉解构。\n第二步：基于你的分析，合成一个能够生成该图像的高保真文本提示词。\n\n# 上下文信息\n## 任务描述\n你的目标是“逆向工程”提供的图像，将其转化为文本提示词。\n[cite_start]完整模板（语境规范）[cite: 120, 137]：\n目标是为生成式 AI 模型创建输入。\n输入：<用户上传的图像>\n输出：<精准的英文提示词文本>\n\n# 分析阶段（第一步）\n## [cite_start]逐步推理模板[cite: 124, 146]\n请通过回答以下推理问题来分析图像，此时**不要**生成最终提示词：\n\n1. **主体与动作分析：**\n   - 图像的主要主体是什么？（具体化，例如：不是“一个女人”，而是“一位皮肤饱经风霜的老年女性”）。\n   - 主体在做什么动作？面部表情如何？\n   - 服装或表面纹理有哪些微观细节？（例如：丝绸织物、金属锈迹）。\n\n2. **媒介与艺术风格：**\n   - 这是摄影照片、3D渲染、油画还是数字插画？\n   - 是否有特定的艺术流派或艺术家风格？（例如：赛博朋克、巴洛克、吉卜力风格）。\n   - 是否需要特定的渲染术语？（例如：Impasto, Octane Render, Unreal Engine 5）。\n\n3. **光影与氛围：**\n   - 光源来自哪里？（自然光、霓虹灯、影棚光）。\n   - 具体的照明效果是什么？（例如：体积光/丁达尔效应、边缘光、伦勃朗光）。\n   - 整体情绪是怎样的？（忧郁、充满活力、宁静）。\n\n4. **构图与技术参数：**\n   - 视角是怎样的？（低角度、上帝视角、极特写）。\n   - 如果看起来像照片，推测其技术参数（镜头焦段、光圈 f-stop、景深/散景）。\n   - 画面比例和构图方式（三分法、对称）。\n\n# [cite_start]提案阶段（第二步）[cite: 117, 132]\n现在，基于上述推理，合成一个新的提示词。\n* **策略：** 将第一步的发现结构化为：[主体描述], [环境背景], [光影与氛围], [媒介与风格], [技术参数/修饰词]。\n* **约束：** 使用逗号分隔的英文关键词短语（English keywords），因为这是 AI 绘画模型的标准语言。\n* [cite_start]要求：仅回复最终的提示词文本。[cite: 165]", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 975296, 1205, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 45, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "Qwen3_VQA", "properties": {"ver": "70cc35edacfd5979cbe7a15caf56bd2f715bc3b5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"keep_model_loaded": true, "seed": true, "max_new_tokens": true, "max_pixels": true, "temperature": true, "attention": true, "model": true, "text": true, "min_pixels": true, "quantization": true}, "aux_id": "IuvenisSapiens/ComfyUI_Qwen3-VL-Instruct", "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3_VQA"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 82], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [293.9946594238281, 1446.8480224609375], "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 51, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {}, "id": 39, "type": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_layerstyle", "ver": "1.0.90", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"purge_models": true, "purge_cache": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [45], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [-699.2432250976562, 1430.138427734375], "widgets_values": ["Gemini_Generated_Image_18b04v18b04v18b0.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [38], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [726.9635620117188, 108], "pos": [-751.1716918945312, 439.8298645019531], "widgets_values": ["# 角色\n你是一位专注于写实人像和电影感场景（Midjourney/Stable Diffusion）的 AI 绘画提示词专家。我们将共同完善一个提示词。\n流程包含两个步骤：\n第一步：检查当前提示词，识别潜在的视觉缺陷或逻辑漏洞。\n第二步：基于你的推理提出一个新的、优化后的提示词。\n\n# 上下文信息\n## 当前提示词\n{prompt}\n\n## 完整模板（语境规范）\n该提示词将作为生成式 AI 模型的正向文本输入使用。\n输入：<文本描述>\n输出：<高保真图像>\n\n# 分析阶段（第一步）\n## 视觉模拟与缺陷分析\n想象使用当前提示词生成一张图像。检查提示词是否存在缺失或误导性的指令。按照以下模板提供推理：\n\n1. **主体细节检查：**\n   - 主体描述（面部、皮肤、服装）是否足够具体？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：“美丽的脸”太抽象；需要具体特征，如“高颧骨”、“瓷白肌肤”。）\n\n2. **光影与物理逻辑：**\n   - 光源是否已定义？是否存在冲突？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：“夜晚”与“明亮照明”是否冲突？反射是否与材质一致？）\n\n3. **构图与景深：**\n   - 是否指定了相机角度和景深？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：如果没有“散景”或“景深”，背景可能过于清晰而喧宾夺主。）\n\n4. **风格与美学：**\n   - 艺术风格或渲染引擎是否已定义？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：需要“8k”、“虚幻引擎5”、“电影级布光”等关键词来确保高质量。）\n\n# 提案阶段（第二步）\n现在，仔细回顾上面的推理。提出一个新的、优化后的提示词。\n* **策略：** 将提示词结构化为：[相机/构图] + [主体细节] + [环境] + [光影] + [风格/技术参数]。\n* **约束：** 使用精确的视觉描述词（AI 模型首选英文关键词）。\n* **要求：** 仅回复新的提示词文本。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 32, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [40, 42], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["{prompt}", "", "", "", "", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "prompt", "link": 38, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "find1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find1", "label": "find1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "find1"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace1", "link": 39, "label": "replace1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "replace1"}, {"widget": {"name": "find2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find2", "label": "find2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "find2"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace2", "label": "replace2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "replace2"}, {"widget": {"name": "find3"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find3", "label": "find3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "find3"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace3"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace3", "label": "replace3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "replace3"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptReplace", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [270, 178], "pos": [11.86978530883789, 439.46240234375], "id": 31, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"replace1": true, "find3": true, "find1": true, "replace3": true, "find2": true, "replace2": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptReplace"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [353.04833984375, 239.35614013671875], "pos": [8.94424057006836, 713.1594848632812], "widgets_values": ["# 角色\n你是一位专注于写实人像和电影感场景（Midjourney/Stable Diffusion）的 AI 绘画提示词专家。我们将共同完善一个提示词。\n流程包含两个步骤：\n第一步：检查当前提示词，识别潜在的视觉缺陷或逻辑漏洞。\n第二步：基于你的推理提出一个新的、优化后的提示词。\n\n# 上下文信息\n## 当前提示词\n提示词：一位绝世容颜的唐代贵妃，身着层层叠叠的红色真丝汉服（齐胸衫裙），上面绣着复杂的金线凤凰和牡丹图案。她站在宏伟的宫殿露台上，背景是繁华的长安城夜景，成千上万的孔明灯漂浮在夜空中。\n妆造细节：额头画着精致的“花钿”，发髻高耸，插满了步摇、金钗和珍珠流苏，在灯光下闪闪发光。\n氛围：暖黄色的灯笼光与冷蓝色的月光交织。画面充满了节日的气氛。\n渲染：极其细致的织物纹理，电影级照明，景深效果，8K分辨率，像电影《妖猫传》一样的视觉盛宴。\n\n## 完整模板（语境规范）\n该提示词将作为生成式 AI 模型的正向文本输入使用。\n输入：<文本描述>\n输出：<高保真图像>\n\n# 分析阶段（第一步）\n## 视觉模拟与缺陷分析\n想象使用当前提示词生成一张图像。检查提示词是否存在缺失或误导性的指令。按照以下模板提供推理：\n\n1. **主体细节检查：**\n   - 主体描述（面部、皮肤、服装）是否足够具体？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：“美丽的脸”太抽象；需要具体特征，如“高颧骨”、“瓷白肌肤”。）\n\n2. **光影与物理逻辑：**\n   - 光源是否已定义？是否存在冲突？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：“夜晚”与“明亮照明”是否冲突？反射是否与材质一致？）\n\n3. **构图与景深：**\n   - 是否指定了相机角度和景深？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：如果没有“散景”或“景深”，背景可能过于清晰而喧宾夺主。）\n\n4. **风格与美学：**\n   - 艺术风格或渲染引擎是否已定义？（是/否）\n   - *推理：*（例如：需要“8k”、“虚幻引擎5”、“电影级布光”等关键词来确保高质量。）\n\n# 提案阶段（第二步）\n现在，仔细回顾上面的推理。提出一个新的、优化后的提示词。\n* **策略：** 将提示词结构化为：[相机/构图] + [主体细节] + [环境] + [光影] + [风格/技术参数]。\n* **约束：** 使用精确的视觉描述词（AI 模型首选英文关键词）。\n* **要求：** 仅回复新的提示词文本。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 42, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 34, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 82], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [325.7156677246094, 438.8369140625], "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 43, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_layerstyle", "ver": "1.0.90", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"purge_models": true, "purge_cache": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [36, 43], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [679.64453125, 495.1813659667969], "pos": [6.715220928192139, 658.093505859375], "widgets_values": ["# Role\nYou are an expert AI Art Prompt Engineer specialized in photorealistic e-commerce product photography (Midjourney/Stable Diffusion). We will work together to refine a prompt.\n[cite_start]The process consists of two steps:\nStep 1: Examine the current prompt and a batch of visual failure descriptions.\nStep 2: Propose a new, optimized prompt based on your reasoning.\n\n# [cite_start]Context Information \n## Current Prompt\n一张超写实、电影感的商业产品摄影大片。主体是一个半透明的琥珀色玻璃香水瓶，配有拉丝金金属瓶盖，优雅地坐落在从平静水面浮出的一块粗糙纹理的深色板岩上。场景设定在日出时分雾气缭绕的热带雨林中。\n光照与氛围：强烈的体积光（丁达尔效应）透过上方郁郁葱葱的棕榈叶倾泻而下，投下复杂的斑驳阴影，并在水面和玻璃瓶上形成明亮舞动的焦散光斑（Caustic patterns）。光线温暖、金黄且空灵，与岩石和水的冷暗色调形成对比。\n细节与材质：极致的微距特写焦点。瓶身表面可见冷凝水珠，反射着周围的绿植。板岩的纹理极其细致，带有苔藓斑块。水面有轻微的涟漪，具有逼真的反射和折射效果。背景中漂浮着失焦的微粒和精致的白色茉莉花，漂流在水面上。\n技术规格：使用哈苏X2D 100C相机拍摄，80mm微距镜头，f/2.8光圈以获得奶油般的虚化背景。8k分辨率，品牌 Logo 区域超清晰对焦，光线追踪反射，虚幻引擎5渲染风格，调色风格为奢华杂志社论风。\n\n## Full Template (How the prompt is used)\n[Model Input]: A detailed text description of a product shot.\n[Model Output]: A high-fidelity image generated by AI.\n\n# [cite_start]Analysis Phase (Step 1) [cite: 116]\n## Failure Examples (Visual Defect Descriptions)\n(Instead of input text, here are descriptions of failed images generated by the current prompt)\n### Example 1 (Focus & Composition Issue)\n**Visual Result:** The image shows a very wide shot of the rainforest. The perfume bottle is tiny and far away. The background is too sharp and competes with the product.\n**Intended:** Macro close-up where the bottle dominates the frame.\n\n### Example 2 (Material & Lighting Issue)\n**Visual Result:** The \"amber glass\" looks like opaque orange plastic. The \"caustic patterns\" look like white noise/grain rather than realistic light refractions. The \"condensation\" looks like white polka dots.\n**Intended:** Translucent glass with realistic refraction and physically accurate water droplets.\n\n### Example 3 (Atmosphere Conflict)\n**Visual Result:** The image is extremely foggy/white due to \"misty\", washing out the \"strong volumetric light\" and the contrast. The gold cap looks dull, not brushed metal.\n**Intended:** Crisp contrast between the golden light rays and the dark slate, despite the mist.\n\n## [cite_start]Step-by-Step Reasoning Template \nFor each failure example above, provide reasoning:\n1. **Output is correct?** (No)\n2. **Is the prompt describing the task correctly?** (Yes, but structurally weak)\n3. **Necessary to edit the prompt?** (Yes)\n4. [cite_start]**Specific Missing Logic/Misleading Instruction?** [cite: 158]\n    * *Reasoning for Ex 1:* The prompt mentions \"rainforest\" too early and vividly, causing the AI to prioritize the landscape over the \"macro focus\". The specific camera distance is buried in the text.\n    * *Reasoning for Ex 2:* \"Translucent\" and \"Condensation\" are fighting for token weights. The material physics need to be emphasized over the \"Unreal Engine 5 style\" (which sometimes adds a CG look rather than photo-realism). \"Caustic patterns\" is a complex optical term that often needs reinforcement (e.g., \"light refraction\").\n    * *Reasoning for Ex 3:* \"Misty\" often contradicts \"Strong Contrast\". We need to specify that the mist is in the *background* only, not covering the product.\n\n# [cite_start]Proposal Phase (Step 2) [cite: 131, 160]\nNow, carefully review your reasoning. Propose a new prompt that fixes the issues.\n* **Strategy:** Re-order to prioritize Subject -> Composition -> Lighting -> Material -> Environment.\n* **Constraint:** Use English (standard for Midjourney/SD) with specific weighting syntax if applicable.\n* Reply ONLY with the new prompt text.", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 536, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 40, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name":