rm amber lantern light contrasting with cool moonlight. Ambient lighting creates soft volumetric glow and reflective highlights on her garments and jewelry. Rendered in 8K resolution, cinematic lighting, Unreal Engine 5 style, hyperrealistic textures, and inspired by the visual grandeur of “The Monkey King: Journey to the West” and “A Dream of the Red Chamber” — a masterpiece of historical realism and atmospheric drama."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 36, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 28, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [3, 4], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1028.9654541015625, 613.7607421875], "widgets_values": ["Extreme close-up macro product shot of a translucent amber glass perfume bottle with a brushed gold metallic cap. The bottle sits on a rough dark slate rock emerging from calm water. Subject Focus: The bottle is the main focal point, covered in realistic condensation droplets reflecting the greenery. Lighting: Strong volumetric golden sunlight (God rays) filtering through palm leaves above, creating intense caustic light patterns dancing on the glass and water. Contrast: Warm golden light against cool dark slate and water tones. Background: Blurred tropical rainforest, morning mist in the distance (bokeh), defocused floating white jasmine flowers. Technical: Shot on Hasselblad X2D 100C, 80mm macro lens, f/2.8 depth of field, 8k resolution, photorealistic, hyper-detailed texture, ray-tracing reflections, editorial photography style. --ar 4:5 --q 2 --style raw"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip"